type: software
title: "cockpit: status line, cost alert and rm -rf guard for Claude Code"
abstract: "A Claude Code plugin that puts context usage and session cost in the status line, adds a budget alert and a /cockpit dashboard with rate limits and MCP server health, and blocks rm -rf and other recursive deletes in Dropbox, iCloud Drive, Google Drive and OneDrive folders."
